{"id": "ru-4b75a0e1bc8d.ru", "jokeId": "ru-4b75a0e1bc8d", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept; narration split where the action changes, the senior doctor's speech split around the narrator's tag. Cast fixed: the patient is a woman of 55 (tyoshcha, portly), two doctors — paren as the very young doctor, doktor as the grey-haired one. Three rooms: office → clinic corridor (queue seated on chairs, she runs on the front plane, the old doctor meets her) → office again.", "title": "Икота", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["paren", "tyoshcha"], "roles": {"paren": "doctor", "tyoshcha": "patient"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Мария Петровна пошла к врачу.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Её записали на приём к совсем молоденькому доктору, только что из института.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "После нескольких минут пребывания в его кабинете,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Мария Петровна выскочила оттуда с дикими криками и воплями", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "и понеслась вдоль по коридору.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Навстречу ей шёл пожилой врач.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он остановил её и поинтересовался, в чём дело.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Когда он вошёл в кабинет молодого врача, вид у него был суровый:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ты что это себе позволяешь,", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "обратился он строго к младшему коллеге,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Марии Петровне пошёл пятьдесят шестой год, у неё взрослая дочь, скоро внук будет, а ты ей говоришь, что она беременна!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Молодой врач, продолжая писать что-то в карточке, ответил:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Но икоточка-то у неё прошла?..", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["paren", "tyoshcha"], "roles": {"paren": "doctor", "tyoshcha": "patient"}, "looks": {"tyoshcha": {"build": "portly"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "act", "who": "paren", "act": "write"}, {"type": "move", "who": "tyoshcha", "from": "off-left", "to": "patient-chair"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "paren", "act": "wave"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "paren", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "act", "who": "tyoshcha", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "tyoshcha", "act": "jump"}, {"type": "move", "who": "tyoshcha", "to": "off-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "bolnitsa", "place": "waiting-room", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "ded", "devushka", "tyoshcha", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "ded": "old-man", "devushka": "woman", "tyoshcha": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "looks": {"tyoshcha": {"build": "portly"}, "muzhik": {"add": ["bandages"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "chair-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "chair-3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "chair-5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "tyoshcha", "from": "off-left", "to": "front-center"}, {"type": "act", "who": "ded", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "from": "off-right", "to": "front-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "doktor", "act": "grab"}, {"type": "act", "who": "tyoshcha", "act": "cry"