{"id": "ru-b0ecacc4cdf7.ru", "jokeId": "ru-b0ecacc4cdf7", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source wording kept; the speech tags («предложила стюардесса», «спросила она», «заметила стюардесса») stay as narrator lines. Cabin with the passenger crowd: the man sits on seat-right, the stewardess walks down the aisle from the galley, stands in the aisle in front of him, fetches glasses from the galley and hands them over; he shivers, nods, drinks, then cries.", "title": "Боязнь полётов", "location": "samolet", "cast": ["devushka-blondinka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-blondinka": "flight-attendant", "muzhik": "customer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Проходя по салону самолёта,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "стюардесса заметила обливающегося потом мужчину, трясущегося и грызущего ногти.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Может быть, я принесу рюмочку коньяку, и вам станет легче?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "предложила стюардесса.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "После явной борьбы с собою мужчина прошептал:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ладно...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Проверяя опять того же пассажира,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "стюардесса обнаружила его в ещё более плачевном состоянии.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Вторую рюмочку?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "спросила она.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Мужчина ничего не ответил и только кивнул головой.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Когда стюардесса вернулась к пассажиру в третий раз,", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "он рыдал бесконтрольно.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Я никогда не видела кого-либо, кто бы так боялся летать,", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "заметила стюардесса, на что пассажир ответил:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я совсем не боюсь летать, я пытаюсь бросить пить!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "samolet", "place": "cabin", "cast": ["devushka-blondinka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka-blondinka": "flight-attendant", "muzhik": "customer"}, "crowd": {"who": "passengers", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "seat-right"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "to": "galley"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "to": "aisle-front"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shiver"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "to": "galley"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "to": "aisle-front"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "item": "glass", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shiver"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-blondinka", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "pro